/Pg 46 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1545 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 730 0 R
/E (Non-Conforming Loans: These do not meet the guidelines of Fannie Mae or Freddie Mac. They include jumbo loans \(which exceed the conforming loan limits\) and loans with unconventional terms or credit requirements. Because they are not eligible for sale to these agencies, they often have higher interest rates and stricter terms.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
