1620 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 735 0 R
/E (VA Loan Entitlement can be tricky to understand. In a basic sense, entitlement refers to how much the VA will guarantee if the borrower defaults. There are three types of entitlement to understand: basic entitlement, bonus entitlement, and restoration of entitlement.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 735 0 R
/E (Basic Entitlement: As of 2020, the VA loan limit went away. What this means is that if you only have one primary-residence home on the VA Loan, you will have full entitlement and no limit on the price of home, as long as you can qualify for it.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
