endobj
1624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 735 0 R
/E (Restoration of Entitlement: If a VA loan is paid off or a property is sold, veterans can restore their full entitlement for future use. This is common when you sell one home and use the VA loan for your next home. If you sell your only home on the VA Loan and restore your entitlement you would have full entitlement and have no max on the home price, as long as you qualify for those loan payments and amount. )
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
