/E (Pro Tip)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1728 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 740 0 R
/E (Making one extra payment per year solely towards Principal can reduce your payoff date from 30 years down to 24 years and save hundreds of thousands of dollars in interest. At the end of each year try and make a payment of just principal. )
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
